# Cross-origin isolation, for Netlify and Cloudflare Pages.
#
# Without these the worker cannot allocate a SharedArrayBuffer, so the 1 kHz
# ticker falls back to setTimeout(0) and loop timing degrades. The page detects
# this and says so, but it is silent otherwise — nothing errors, it just paces
# worse, which is the least helpful kind of failure.
#
# GitHub Pages cannot serve custom headers at all, so it cannot host this
# without that fallback.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
